## 1 Introduction
**Paper:** Routing-Free Mixture-of-Experts · §1 · pages 1–1 · equations (1–2) · 25 figures.

**Where the block sits.** Attention with a residual (eq. 1), then the MoE with a
residual (eq. 2). Nothing controversial — it fixes the notation so the object being replaced is
unambiguous: the `MoE(·)` in eq. 2.

